        rules: {
          objective: "Score 501 points through tricks and 'Marianna' bonuses.",
          gameplay: '1. No obligation to follow suit initially.\n2. After each trick, players draw 1 card from the stock to stay at 5 cards.\n3. Once the stock is empty, players must follow suit (in some variations).\n4. The highest card of the suit led wins, unless someone trumps it.',
          keyRules: [
            'No obligation to follow suit; play any card. Trick won by highest of led suit, or highest trump if any trumps played.',
            'After each trick, winner draws first then each player in order so everyone has five cards again. Winner leads next trick.',
            'Declare marianna (king and queen of same suit) at your turn to score bonus and set or change trump. First 40, second 60, third 80, fourth 100 points.',
            'After the last card is drawn from the stock, no more mariannas; last five tricks played from hand without drawing.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Race for the first Marianna. Since it sets the trump, being the first to declare is a massive advantage. If you have a King and Knight, declare it immediately, even if it's your first card.",
          intermediate: "The Trump Switch: If your opponents declared the first Marianna (setting trumps to Hearts), and you have a Marianna in Diamonds, wait until they've led their high Hearts before you declare YOUR Marianna. This switches the trump suit and renders their high Hearts useless.",
          advanced: 'Draw-Deck Management: Since you draw a card after every trick, you have 5-10 draws to complete a Marianna. If you have only a King, keep it! The probability of drawing its Knight is about 1 in 8 for each draw.',
          tips: [
            "Track the 'Points of the Table': Ace and 3 are 21 points combined. Don't play them until the trump suit is firmly established by your team.",
            "In the 'Cinquecento' (500 pt) variant, remember that speed is everythingâ€”the bonus points for Mariannas are the fastest way to 501.",
